- The **ego vehicle** (viewpoint) is on a **two-lane road** with **fog reducing visibility beyond ~50 meters**.
- The **no-entry sign** is positioned on the **right side**, indicating restricted entry for vehicles.
- The **billboards** are on the **left side**, attached to poles.
